WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.156 --> 00:00:02.120
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:07.899
Today, I’m going to explain an action science
fiction film called “Bad Land: Road to Fury.”

00:00:07.899 --> 00:00:09.269
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:09.269 --> 00:00:10.562
Watch out and take care!

00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:16.960
At the beginning of the movie, we see a large
barren land.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:21.550
A young man named Jerome Holm, narrates to
us that he hasn’t seen this land when it

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:23.640
was green, but his father has.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:28.630
Years ago, it used to be home to several farmers
who grew wheat and grains on it.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:33.130
However, after drought struck the land, not
a single plant has been able to grow.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:38.230
Most of the farmers left the place but Jerome's
father, Ernest, hoped the land would be green again.

00:00:38.965 --> 00:00:41.205
He still believes that it just needs some
water.

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:44.510
But in this world, people kill each other
for water.

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:48.700
In the first scene, we see two muggers trying
to break into a tiny house.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:50.940
Earnest catches them and kills the first one.

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:54.800
The second mugger tries to convince him to
spare his life, but is killed when he secretly

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.220
takes a gun out.

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:59.300
His son, Jerome, insists he could have helped
him.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:03.280
The house the muggers were breaking into,
has an old water pump that stops working when

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:05.089
Ernest tries to use it.

00:01:05.089 --> 00:01:09.020
With no water left, the father and son make
their way on a mule to the “waterman”,

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:12.670
people who extract water from deep wells through
a government deal.

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:15.399
Ernest exchanges supply with those people
for water.

00:01:15.399 --> 00:01:18.979
He has been trying to convince them to provide
him with water to cultivate a small part of

00:01:18.979 --> 00:01:20.420
his land for years.

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:25.310
However, the watermen only do it for the right
amount of money that Ernest cannot afford.

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:28.899
On their way back, their mule falls down and
breaks its leg.

00:01:28.899 --> 00:01:31.190
Earnest reluctantly shoots the animal dead.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:35.679
The two come back home to Jerome’s sister,
Mary, serving them bag food.

00:01:35.679 --> 00:01:39.560
Because of water scarcity, we see Mary cleansing
the dishes with soil.

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:43.530
The following day, Jerome and Ernest visit
Sam Lever's auction house to get something

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:45.139
to replace the mule who died.

00:01:45.139 --> 00:01:50.744
There, a robotic carrier machine called Simulit
Shadow (Sim) catches their eyes.

00:01:50.744 --> 00:01:54.925
Ernest wins the auction against a man named
Flem Lever, who also happens to be Sam’s son.

00:01:55.859 --> 00:01:59.318
Flem is having an affair with Mary, unknown
to Ernest and Jerome.

00:01:59.649 --> 00:02:03.080
The two then go to meet Jerome’s sick mother,
Katherine Holm.

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:07.509
She lives in a nearby hospital where she can
walk while wired to a special frame.

00:02:07.509 --> 00:02:11.250
Since the frame is too expensive, they cannot
bring her home.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:15.320
Jerome spends his time with his mother that
day; Ernest and Katherine kiss goodbye and seperate.

00:02:15.923 --> 00:02:19.103
On their way back, Ernest and Jerome stop
at a gas station.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:23.170
We see Ernest take a gulp of petrol after
pumping it into his vehicle.

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:26.850
The two encounter a couple with a young baby,
begging for water.

00:02:26.850 --> 00:02:31.010
The father, Robbie, wants to sell the baby
because they cannot afford to take care of

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:35.460
him, but Ernest advises against it and tells
him that he’ll help them with water.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:39.050
Robbie knows of Flem and Mary’s affair,
and hints Earnest towards it.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:43.400
At home, Ernest confronts Mary about her sneaking
out frequently, but she claims that it is

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:46.250
her freedom and tells her father that she
hates him.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:50.890
She tries running away, but Ernest locks her
in her room and nails her windows shut.

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:56.530
One morning, Ernest and Jerome wake up to
Sim absent from its shed.

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:58.180
Someone had stolen it.

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:02.070
Ernest assumes it was Flem and goes to his
house, but finds out from Sam, that he has

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:04.930
left with a truck that morning for the mountains.

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:08.820
Ernest then goes looking for him to the watermen,
but they knock him unconscious.

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:11.830
When he regains consciousness, it is already
night.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:14.732
The watermen accuse him of stealing their
supplies.

00:03:14.732 --> 00:03:19.152
Ernest insists that he didn’t steal them,
but their leader, Caleb, attacks him.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:23.500
They fight for a while, but Ernest manages
to get his hands on his rifle and run away from there.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:29.300
On his way back home, he discovers Flem sleeping
on the road with sim by his side, it is clear

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:32.650
that he had stolen the machine and the watermen’s
supplies.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:36.730
Earnest points the rifle at him, holds him
hostage, then ties him to the machine.

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:40.090
He wants to take Flem back to the watermen
to prove his innocence.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:44.380
On their way, Flem makes comments about Mary,
which angers Ernest.

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:47.240
After walking for a while, both of them get
thirsty.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:50.740
Flem persuades Ernest to use the water from
the watermen’s supply.

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:53.220
The two sit down to drink water and chat.

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:56.940
Flem then tries to convince Ernest to let
him go, and they can share the money, but

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:59.490
Ernest is adamant about getting him caught.

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:03.620
Ernest is weak and limp, he clearly cannot
walk another mile to the waterman.

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:08.610
Flem knows this, so he strikes Ernest with
a stone, making him hit his head on a cliff.

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:12.430
His head starts to bleed uncontrollably and
is knocked unconscious.

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:15.180
Ernest wakes up to him being tied instead
of Flem.

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:18.180
Flem pours water into Ernest’s mouth as
he screams.

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:22.520
Later, we see Flem arrive at Ernest’s house
in his motorbike to take Mary.

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.540
She happily runs out to him.

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:27.750
Earnest still hasn’t been home, so Jerome
goes out to look for him.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:30.100
He finds the machine alone on the way.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:33.880
When he reaches the watermen, they inform
him of Ernest’s death.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.630
Everyone assumes that it was caused by the
machine.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:40.330
In the following scene, we see everyone mourning
Ernest’s death at his funeral.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:44.360
Later, Kathrine and the kids cry in her hospital
bed.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:47.379
When they come out, Flem picks them up in
his truck.

00:04:47.379 --> 00:04:51.139
After Ernest's death, Flem has now become
the mentor of the family.

00:04:51.139 --> 00:04:54.169
He calms Jerome down as he hits Sim for killing
his father.

00:04:54.169 --> 00:04:58.629
Later, he tells him that Mary is pregnant
with his child and that he loves her.

00:04:58.629 --> 00:05:00.490
Jerome accepts their relationship.

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:05.310
Later that day, Flem goes to the watermen
and talks to them about sending water to Ernest’s land.

00:05:05.863 --> 00:05:10.233
Caleb laughs at his idea, but gets defensive
when Flem blames him for Ernest’s death.

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:14.419
Flem also shows him a knife with Caleb’s
name that was found with Ernest’s body.

00:05:14.419 --> 00:05:18.759
Scared to be accused, Caleb agrees to divert
water to their field.

00:05:18.759 --> 00:05:21.960
Everyone is happy when the land gets its first
sprinkle of water.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:24.600
Flem works day and night to grow wheat on
the land.

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:27.379
A few months later, they are fully grown.

00:05:27.379 --> 00:05:31.680
Flem gets married to Mary and currently livz
at Ernest's home with Jerome and Mary.

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:36.590
One day, his father, Sam, with some men from
the bank approaches their house, threatening

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:39.129
to take the land because of Ernest's debt.

00:05:39.129 --> 00:05:42.870
The debt is too much for Flem to pay, so he
takes the machine with him and approaches

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.729
his friend Robbie that night.

00:05:44.729 --> 00:05:48.550
He knows about Robbies intention to sell his
child so he persuades Robbie to come with

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:51.310
him, just to see how much a baby can be worth.

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:55.590
However, when they reach there, Robbie realizes
that Flem has secretly made a deal with the

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:57.380
people to sell his baby.

00:05:57.380 --> 00:06:02.020
The people try to take the baby away, Robbie
resists it and is shot dead by Flem.

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:05.599
This causes a shootout between the dealers
and Flen runs away with the money.

00:06:05.599 --> 00:06:09.159
However, the machine, Sim, is shot and damaged.

00:06:09.159 --> 00:06:13.909
This activates the auto mode in the machine
which causes it to return back to its manufacturer,

00:06:13.909 --> 00:06:15.449
Calvin Hooyman.

00:06:15.449 --> 00:06:19.760
The following day, Flem pays the bank from
the money he sold the child with.

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:24.180
Jerome assumes that the money came by selling
sim, so no one suspects anything.

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:28.440
In the following scene, we see Sim limping
its way back to Calvin, who lives across the border.

00:06:29.159 --> 00:06:32.970
Calvin calls the number inscribed on Sim and
reaches Holm's residence.

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:36.900
He talks to Jerome about the machine coming
back to him, which shocks Jerome, because

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:39.789
Flem had told him he sold it to Robbie.

00:06:39.789 --> 00:06:44.229
Jerome asks Flem if Robbie sold Sim’s parts
and it somehow made to the owner, but Flem

00:06:44.229 --> 00:06:46.830
gets annoyed at him for the question and dismisses
it.

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:50.809
Then, he tells them he is going to meet his
mother that evening, but instead he plans

00:06:50.809 --> 00:06:54.490
to cross the border to meet Calvin, the manufacturer
of Sim.

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:58.701
Later, he reaches the border, but the guard
stops him because he is too young to cross it.

00:06:59.367 --> 00:07:03.310
A girl named Anna calls him over, and tells
him she knows a way he can go to the other side.

00:07:04.039 --> 00:07:08.339
In exchange for money, she puts him in a vehicle
with chickens and sends him over.

00:07:08.339 --> 00:07:11.030
They meet again at the other side and separate.

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.529
Jerome then goes to meet Calvin.

00:07:12.529 --> 00:07:15.919
There, Calvin shows him all the functions
of the machine.

00:07:15.919 --> 00:07:19.629
He also shows that the machine’s eyes are
cameras, that were made to capture the slope

00:07:19.629 --> 00:07:21.270
for reforestation.

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:24.419
The camera has captured all that the machine
has seen.

00:07:24.419 --> 00:07:27.449
Jerome plays the recordings and sees his time
with Ernest.

00:07:27.449 --> 00:07:31.849
As he goes through it, he is horrified to
see that Flem was the one who killed Ernest.

00:07:31.849 --> 00:07:36.840
That day, after Ernest had gained consciousness,
Flem tied him to the machine and set its destination

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:38.129
to the watermen.

00:07:38.129 --> 00:07:41.580
The machine had dragged an injured but alive
Ernest to his death.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:44.589
By the end of the video, tears roll down Jerome’s
eyes.

00:07:44.589 --> 00:07:49.180
In the evening, he returns home, but doesn’t
confront Flem about anything.

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:54.050
One day, Flem and Jerome are hunting deers,
after which Jerome keeps the rifle with him,

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:56.129
hiding it under his bed for the future.

00:07:56.129 --> 00:08:00.080
At breakfast, Jerome tells Flem about Robbie
calling him.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:04.969
Flem is surprised and accuses Jerome of lying,
because he knows Robbie is already dead.

00:08:04.969 --> 00:08:08.849
Later, Flem receives a letter, written by
Jerome as Robbie.

00:08:08.849 --> 00:08:12.650
The letter asks Flem to meet Robie at the
same place he has killed Ernest.

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:16.990
He is confused by this, but he decides to
find out whether Robie is still alive.

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:21.409
Later at night, Flem tells a pregnant Mary
that he has to go out to sell something.

00:08:21.409 --> 00:08:24.620
Mary wishes him luck, and asks him to come
back soon.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:27.229
When Flem reaches the place, he calls for
Robbie.

00:08:27.229 --> 00:08:30.789
As he walks, he falls down a pit and breaks
his legs.

00:08:30.789 --> 00:08:34.459
He lies there calling for help, when Jerome
appears in front of him.

00:08:34.459 --> 00:08:38.440
Seeing him there, Flem takes a sigh of relief
and asks him for help.

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:41.659
However, Jerome stands there with a rock in
his hand.

00:08:41.659 --> 00:08:45.630
Flem realizes that he knows everything that
happened and apologizes to him, claiming it

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:47.480
was just an accident.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:51.769
He begs him to spare his life for Mary and
their child, but Jerome doesn’t listen.

00:08:51.769 --> 00:08:54.220
He points the rifle at Flem and shoots him
dead.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.610
It has been two days since the event.

00:08:56.610 --> 00:09:00.710
Mary is worried about her husband, but Jerome
asks her to wait a little more.

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:04.779
He has decided to keep Mary in the dark about
both Ernest’s and Flem’s death.

00:09:04.779 --> 00:09:08.490
Mary suggests they bring their mother home,
because they now have the money to afford

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:10.540
the wringing system she lives in.

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:14.810
The movie ends as Jerome erases all the video
memory from Sim.

00:09:14.810 --> 00:09:18.409
